1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,320
Why can only one company build this

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,020
machine?

3
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,990
The most advanced chips in your phone are

4
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:05,750
printed with it.

5
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,940
And no other company sells one.

6
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:11,060
Inside, it fires fifty thousand drops of

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,490
molten tin every second.

8
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:14,950
A laser hits each drop twice: first to

9
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,990
flatten it, then to blast it into plasma,

10
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,730
hotter than the surface of the Sun.

11
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:21,530
That plasma glows with extreme ultraviolet

12
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:24,170
light, which can draw lines thousands of

13
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:25,590
times thinner than a hair.

14
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,750
Its mirrors are so smooth that, scaled up

15
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,870
to the size of Germany, the tallest bump

16
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:33,350
would be no higher than a millimetre.

17
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,280
Decades of work, in one machine...

18
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,500
that's why nobody can copy it.
